{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13677","headline":"游灞陵山 · 严维","name":"游灞陵山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入山未尽意，胜迹聊独寻。\n方士去在昔，药堂留至今。\n四隅白云闲，一路清溪深。\n芳秀惬春目，高闲宜远心。\n潭分化丹水，路遶昇仙林。\n此道人不悟，坐鸣松下琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}